#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:5 29b1e44b9cfb4fa3be36e24e559f0a51
msgid "Archived:Using Xbee radios for telemetry with APM"
msgstr "已归档：使用 Xbee 无线电模块与 APM 进行数传"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:9 924879ba6f2644bea085f058f378233c
msgid "**ARCHIVED ARTICLE**"
msgstr "**已归档文章**"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:11 1a9c00733977449990708e59d12a9eb7
msgid ""
"The correct topic to use is :ref:`Telemetry-XBee <common-telemetry-xbee>`"
msgstr "请使用 :ref:`Telemetry-XBee <common-telemetry-xbee>` 主题"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:18 2abd8a8abe8e4507bfb7231be0cba674
msgid "Hooking up your Xbee wireless modules"
msgstr "连接您的 Xbee 无线模块"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:20 c30e789d298f4110b88d96176afa4c34
msgid ""
"Adding wireless telemetry is not difficult and can extend the capabilities "
"of your UAV immensely. We recommend `900Mhz Xbees "
"<https://www.sparkfun.com/categories/222.html>`__. If you are in Europe, "
"where 900Mhz is not allowed, you can use a 2.4Ghz Xbee kit instead."
msgstr ""
"添加无线数传并不困难，可以极大地扩展您 UAV 的功能。我们推荐使用 `900MHz Xbee "
"<https://www.sparkfun.com/categories/222.html>`__。如果您在欧洲（不允许使用 900MHz），可以改用 "
"2.4GHz Xbee 套件。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:27 d97984dbb2a04cada2576ac2ca28f904
msgid ""
"On APM 2, you cannot use the Xbee while your APM board is connected to the "
"USB port."
msgstr "在 APM 2 上，当 APM 板通过 USB 端口连接时，无法同时使用 Xbee。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:30 0548db9595794a0387c185ceb99e9bc9
msgid ""
"That's because the Xbee and USB share the same serial port, with some clever"
" multiplexing to detect if the USB cable is plugged in and switching output "
"to the USB if so. Although that has the huge win of freeing up a serial port"
" for some other use (e.g. connect an Android phone), it does mean that you "
"need to disconnect the board from the USB cable and power it some other way "
"when testing wireless telemetry on your bench."
msgstr ""
"这是因为 Xbee 和 USB 共用同一串口，通过巧妙的多路复用来检测 USB 线缆是否插入，并在插入时将输出切换至 "
"USB。尽管这样做的好处是释放了一个串口供其他用途（例如连接 Android 手机），但这意味着在桌面测试无线数传时，需要断开板与 USB "
"线缆的连接，并通过其他方式供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:36 5571d8910b574b029aa9a8342a5fc228
msgid "Wiring it up"
msgstr "接线方法"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:39 7698a51544a942bda0245d9963d76262
msgid "APM 2.0"
msgstr "APM 2.0"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:47 87d1f737558547c18f1600fa12b521b7
msgid ""
"Connect the XtremeBee adapter (with the Xbee plugged in) to APM 2 as shown "
"above. Your adapter should be in \"Master\" mode. (\"Master\" and \"Slave\" "
"just reverse the TX and RX pins)."
msgstr ""
"如上图所示，将 XtremeBee 适配器（已插入 Xbee）连接到 APM 2。您的适配器应处于 「Master」 模式（「Master」 和 "
"「Slave」 只是交换了 TX 和 RX 引脚）。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:51 44dfb4936f2e440b8d8d5a06045c22a4
msgid ""
"We recommend the 3DR four-wire Xbee cable, which comes with the official "
"Wireless Telemetry kit shown above. It is designed to connect the XtreamBee "
"adapter to APM, as it will provide the neatest and safest connection."
msgstr ""
"我们推荐使用 3DR 四线 Xbee 线缆，随官方无线数传套件附带（如上图所示）。该线缆专为将 XtreamBee 适配器连接到 APM "
"而设计，能提供最整洁、安全的连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:57 d9ad3c92d8c14be0ac9977aa8d8c6f39
msgid "APM 2.5"
msgstr "APM 2.5"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:59 b35f4a97e194486ea34303d178a28c81
msgid ""
"On APM 2.5, use the dedicated telemetry port and supplied cable, as shown:"
msgstr "在 APM 2.5 上，使用专用数传端口和配套线缆，如图所示："

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:66 8f9c35ab871345c3a3b25a102a253f42
msgid "On the ground side"
msgstr "地面端"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:68 22d18ab89bc847e0837e1f74028cec61
msgid ""
"If you're using a USB adapter, simply connect it via a USB cable as shown:"
msgstr "如果您使用 USB 适配器，只需通过 USB 线缆连接即可，如图所示："

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:73 e861790a630e40758c5bab219947488a
msgid ""
"If you're using an XtreamBee adapter on the ground side, connect it to a "
"FTDI cable as shown below and plug that into your USB port. The adapter "
"should also be in Master mode."
msgstr ""
"如果您在地面端使用 XtreamBee 适配器，请将其连接到 FTDI 线缆（如下图所示），然后插入 USB 端口。适配器同样应处于 Master "
"模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:80 a5a70997d606492eb5cf8080c5b576a5
msgid "XBee with XtreemBee Adapter"
msgstr "XBee 与 XtreemBee 适配器"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:82 23063eae1da44996a62c9adcc077c30a
msgid ""
"Now you're done! Remember to select the right Xbee port (you can see which "
"one has been assigned to the Xbee in the Windows Control Panel device "
"manager) and a baud rate of 57k in the Mission Planner or other GCS when "
"you're connecting."
msgstr ""
"大功告成！连接时请记得在 Mission Planner 或其他地面站中选择正确的 Xbee 端口（可在 Windows "
"控制面板的设备管理器中查看分配给 Xbee 的端口），并将波特率设置为 57k。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:91 3e1ce49e616d4d91ab32e0bd9d782b89
msgid "(Optional) Changing your telemetry to use UART2 (aka Serial3)"
msgstr "（可选）将数传切换为使用 UART2（即 Serial3）"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:93 424b0b9f816e4bf09877640b1c1ec77e
msgid ""
"By default an Xbee connected to the APM2 will use UART0 (aka \"Serial\" in "
"Arduino) which is shared with the USB as mentioned above. If you wish to "
"instead use UART2 (aka \"Serial3\") for telemetry you can change the "
"\"AutoMUX UART0\" jumper on the bottom of the APM2."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，连接到 APM2 的 Xbee 将使用 UART0（即 Arduino 中的 「Serial」），该端口与 USB "
"共用（如上所述）。如果希望改用 UART2（即 「Serial3」）进行数传，可以更改 APM2 底部的 「AutoMUX UART0」 跳线。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:98 b19e815b9e304f17b28752773da8abb0
msgid ""
"Although difficult to see, by default there are two small jumpers between "
"the upper pads that must be cut with an X-Acto blade. Then a new solder "
"bridge must be made to join the bottom pads."
msgstr "虽然难以看清，但默认情况下上方焊盘之间有两个小跳线，必须用美工刀切断。然后需要在下方焊盘之间重新焊接连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:106 7d2bbe5fe88747079f0cd12d48b2a9dc
msgid "(Optional) Rolling your own Xbee telemetry setup"
msgstr "（可选）自制 Xbee 数传方案"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:108 b89f38401ed14f23a9c4f1501418b915
msgid ""
"You can make your own telemetry kit if you'd like. The first thing to keep "
"in mind is that you should use Xbee modules in a different frequency range "
"than your RC equipment."
msgstr "如果您愿意，可以自制数传套件。首先要注意的是，Xbee 模块应使用与您的 RC 设备不同的频段。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:112 85e45777ab6a41e288a2f7679e2fd630
msgid ""
"In general, we recommend 900Mhz Xbee modules, but in some countries 900Mhz "
"is not approved. In those cases you can use 2.4Ghz Xbee modules. In that "
"configuration, we use *Xbee Pro wireless modules*"
msgstr ""
"一般来说，我们推荐 900MHz Xbee 模块，但部分国家不允许使用 900MHz。在这种情况下，可以使用 2.4GHz Xbee "
"模块。该配置下，我们使用 *Xbee Pro 无线模块*"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:116 bcbebff40b194e10b9e186e55b498811
msgid ""
"Setup can be a little tricky, so please see the comments below in this "
"manual to see how other people have done it. In particular, we do not "
"recommend the DIY Drones XtreamBee adapter for those modules. Instead, try "
"the"
msgstr ""
"设置可能有些复杂，请参阅本手册下方的评论，了解其他用户的操作方法。特别需要注意的是，对于这些模块，我们不推荐使用 DIY Drones "
"XtreamBee 适配器，建议改用"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:121 1fd364611351472c9d21699fb1d81c0b
msgid ""
"`Sparkfun <https://www.sparkfun.com/categories/111>`__ adapters. Please note"
" that the DIY Drones team will only support the recommended 900Mhz Xbee "
"modules, so if you use something else please turn the community for help, "
"not the DIY Drones developers."
msgstr ""
"`Sparkfun <https://www.sparkfun.com/categories/111>`__ 适配器。请注意，DIY Drones "
"团队仅支持推荐的 900MHz Xbee 模块，如果您使用其他产品，请向社区寻求帮助，而非联系 DIY Drones 开发者。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:126 6ba9c0e82d6c4a319695353ff2207366
msgid ""
"`Here is more discussion <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/some-tips-on-"
"picking-frequencies>`__ on how to pick the best frequencies for your setup."
msgstr ""
"`这里有更多关于如何为您的设置选择最佳频率的讨论 <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/some-tips-on-"
"picking-frequencies>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:129 dbed471ea94340038f7ecd8aa1d5ff43
msgid "All Xbee modules need adapters to work with APM. You have two choices:"
msgstr "所有 Xbee 模块都需要适配器才能与 APM 配合使用。您有两种选择："

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:131 8ec718676b474f1a9f47127441b9a7b7
msgid ""
"A DIY Drones XtreamBee adapters on the aircraft side, and a *USB adapter "
"board* on the ground/laptop side with a USB cable."
msgstr "飞机端使用 DIY Drones XtreamBee 适配器，地面/笔记本端使用 *USB 适配器板* 和 USB 线缆。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:133 6c597320ae8a4e738570491d31f83578
msgid ""
"If you already have an FTDI cable, get two DIY Drones XtreamBee adapters."
msgstr "如果您已有 FTDI 线缆，可购买两个 DIY Drones XtreamBee 适配器。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:137 e81d017005a6433b94449f9dceb2e8f6
msgid "Setting up the Xbee modules"
msgstr "配置 Xbee 模块"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:139 99efbd76d52b417eb1484f0a0f5b3623
msgid ""
"If you have the DIY Drones Telemetry Kit, your Xbee modules are already set "
"up and ready to go. But if you're setting up your own, here are some "
"instructions:"
msgstr "如果您拥有 DIY Drones 数传套件，您的 Xbee 模块已配置好，可以直接使用。但如果是自行配置，以下是一些说明："

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:143 8a182b43e3ed480b8706f6180ebda33d
msgid ""
"The Xbee modules ship with a default of 9600bps, which you must change to "
"match the APM's serial speed of 57600 bps; set your Xbee modules to match "
"this speed. (If you want to use a different speed, you can change that by "
"entering the following line in the APM_Config.h file: ``#define "
":ref:`SERIAL3_BAUD<SERIAL3_BAUD>` [whatever baud rate you want]``)"
msgstr ""
"Xbee 模块出厂默认波特率为 9600bps，必须更改为与 APM 串口速度 57600 bps 匹配；请将 Xbee "
"模块设置为此速度。（如需使用其他速度，可在 APM_Config.h 文件中添加以下代码进行更改：``#define "
":ref:`SERIAL3_BAUD<SERIAL3_BAUD>` [所需波特率]``）"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:148 8b38f28d9be94b608cc08f4601d7613a
msgid ""
"Connect each one of the them to the USB adapter board, plug the USB cable "
"into your PC, and use Digi's X-CTU utility (Mac/Linux users see section "
"below on an alternative utility from motosenso) to select the right serial "
"port and communicate with them. Remember to initially set the utility to "
"9600bps to contact the new Xbee modules, and than after you've changed the "
"speed, change the utility's serial speed accordingly. You should also give "
"the modules unique Network IDs (VIDs) so they will be paired. Just use any "
"3-digit number, and just make sure you have set it the same on both modules."
" (Note: If you will be flying near other UAV planes make sure to verify the "
"Network IDs are unique and not used by others in your vicinity.)"
msgstr ""
"将每个模块连接到 USB 适配器板，将 USB 线缆插入 PC，使用 Digi 的 X-CTU 工具（Mac/Linux 用户请参见下方关于 "
"motosenso 替代工具的章节）选择正确的串口并与其通信。请记住初始连接时将工具设置为 9600bps 与新 Xbee "
"模块通信，更改速度后再相应调整工具的串口速度。您还应为模块分配唯一的网络 "
"ID（VID）使其配对，使用任意三位数字，确保两个模块设置一致即可。（注意：如果您在其他 UAV 飞机附近飞行，请确认网络 ID "
"唯一且未被附近他人使用。）"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:160 8374f0f6e9c34eb7a0f4296878b05500
msgid ""
"This is what the setting should look like when you click \"Read\" in Modem "
"Configuration tab of X-CTU (we're using 999 as the VID here as an example, "
"and I've highlighted the correct baud rate):"
msgstr ""
"在 X-CTU 的 Modem Configuration 选项卡中点击 「Read」 后，设置应如下图所示（此处以 999 作为 VID "
"示例，已高亮显示正确的波特率）："

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:167 5b070bd102df4673bfe2bb6d593b425d
msgid ""
"Note: If you bought your Xbee modules from Sparkfun, rather than the "
"official DIY Drones kit, please note that they sometimes ship with the wrong"
" firmware. X-CTU may try to download new code, which will probably fail "
"(cancel it). If your Xbee module is reporting that it's an XBP09-DM (rather "
"than the correct XBP09-DP), do the following:"
msgstr ""
"注意：如果您从 Sparkfun 购买 Xbee 模块而非官方 DIY Drones 套件，请注意它们有时会预装错误的固件。X-CTU "
"可能尝试下载新代码，这可能会失败（取消即可）。如果您的 Xbee 模块报告为 XBP09-DM（而非正确的 XBP09-DP），请执行以下操作："

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:173 0eaf655bbd89431ea183bdb6ff813426
msgid ""
"If you have the XBP09-DP modules, you must download XBP09-DP firmware. If "
"you have downloaded XBP09-DM firmware, it will kind-of work, but will fail "
"at the PID-config screen."
msgstr ""
"如果您有 XBP09-DP 模块，必须下载 XBP09-DP 固件。如果下载了 XBP09-DM 固件，它勉强能工作，但在 PID 配置界面会失败。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:176 546b076584bf4c6a82ea6a91147efa93
msgid ""
"X-CTU will report the module as XBP09-DM. Ignore that. Go to the Modem "
"Configuration tab and do the following:"
msgstr "X-CTU 会将该模块识别为 XBP09-DM，忽略该信息。进入 Modem Configuration 选项卡并执行以下操作："

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:179 69364decfc0f4a8baf15a11a49c330c1
msgid ""
"Select Modem as XBP09-DP, Function Set XBEE-PRO 900, Version 1002. It is "
"important that you select 1002. Version 1061 does not work at first."
msgstr ""
"将 Modem 选择为 XBP09-DP，Function Set 选择 XBEE-PRO 900，Version 选择 1002。务必选择 "
"1002，Version 1061 初始时无法正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:182 7eda446b7ae4451f9db8fd08722a3845
msgid "Click the Show Defaults button under the Parameter View."
msgstr "点击参数视图下方的 「Show Defaults」 按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:183 baac00e549b94e70b0cddadd103d86bc
msgid "Click the Write button under \"Modem Parameters and Firmware\"."
msgstr "点击 「Modem Parameters and Firmware」 下方的 「Write」 按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:184 dcf473a4279b4465917df99801b3565f
msgid ""
"Go back to PC Settings, change Baud to 9600. Click Query. It will show "
"XBP09-DM. Ignore that."
msgstr "返回 PC Settings，将波特率改为 9600，点击 Query，将显示 XBP09-DM，忽略该信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:186 faff11165b954216bbcd2a1017456c75
msgid ""
"Go back to Modem Configuration. Click Read. It should show XBP09-DP as the "
"modem. Version 1002."
msgstr "返回 Modem Configuration，点击 Read，此时应显示调制解调器为 XBP09-DP，Version 1002。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:188 04c46b5b53164b82892e51fb8a844ee4
msgid "Now select Version 1061."
msgstr "现在选择 Version 1061。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:189 b1ac2f15cf1844d49607079bdc262ded
msgid "Click \"Show Defaults\""
msgstr "点击 「Show Defaults」"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:190 2b074799338e47b59c8525b648560c59
msgid ""
"Click on the DD parameter and set it to 0. This step is important, otherwise"
" the 1161 firmware download will fail."
msgstr "点击 DD 参数并将其设置为 0。此步骤非常重要，否则 1161 固件下载将失败。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:192 8c077e328eb44ae6b724d92fd9119eac
msgid "Click \"Write\". Now your firmware is XBP09-DP Version 1161."
msgstr "点击 「Write」。您的固件现在是 XBP09-DP Version 1161。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:194 89d045eb118047c79a824c58b68a3c8b
msgid ""
"Now change the baud rate and Modem VID, redownload and you should be good to"
" go."
msgstr "现在更改波特率和 Modem VID，重新下载，应该就可以使用了。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:197 b712b4a0d226427bb2295bdcc2dc7dce
msgid ""
"It will still show XBP09-DM in the PC Settings Query. Don't worry about "
"that."
msgstr "在 PC Settings 查询中仍会显示 XBP09-DM，不用担心。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:201 aba65044f4f6465e8451e881cae20f85
msgid "For Non-PC users"
msgstr "非 PC 用户"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:203 05a0a36643f14399b5a6450131779218
msgid ""
"MacOS, Linux or Windows users - there is a free cross-platform alternative "
"to X-CTU, called moltosenso Network Manager. Download the software `here "
"<https://www.moltosenso.com/client/fe/browser.php?pc=/client/fe/download.php>`__."
" The moltosenso Team collaborated with us writing a `special tutorial "
"<https://forum.moltosenso.com/viewtopic.php?f=16&t=8#p9>`__ on the setup of "
"Xbee radios for ArduPilot and Copter Telemetry using their software. Enjoy!"
msgstr ""
"MacOS、Linux 或 Windows 用户——有一款免费的跨平台 X-CTU 替代工具，名为 moltosenso Network "
"Manager。请在 `此处 "
"<https://www.moltosenso.com/client/fe/browser.php?pc=/client/fe/download.php>`__"
" 下载软件。moltosenso 团队与我们合作，撰写了一篇 `专题教程 "
"<https://forum.moltosenso.com/viewtopic.php?f=16&t=8#p9>`__，介绍如何使用其软件为 "
"ArduPilot 和 Copter 数传配置 Xbee 无线电模块，欢迎参阅！"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:213 45736f9ef61241208d8194e8272b1676
msgid "Testing the connection"
msgstr "测试连接"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:215 e73d12a94b7e46dab28d60e18e82b884
msgid ""
"If you open up a terminal program on your laptop (you can use the Arduino "
"IDE's serial monitor for this, too), select the correct serial port, and set"
" the baud rate to whatever you set the Xbee modules to above (the default is"
" 57600). Once you do this, you should see APM telemetry coming in. Anytime "
"there is a \"Serial3.println\" in the code, that data will be sent through "
"the Xbees to the ground. You can record any data you want, and even datalog "
"from the ground! You can also open the Ground Station software, setting the "
"right port and baud speed) and it should begin to show APM data."
msgstr ""
"在笔记本上打开终端程序（也可以使用 Arduino IDE 的串口监视器），选择正确的串口，将波特率设置为您之前为 Xbee 模块设定的值（默认为 "
"57600）。完成后应能看到 APM 数传数据传入。代码中每次出现 「Serial3.println」 时，该数据都会通过 Xbee "
"发送到地面。您可以记录任何想要的数据，甚至可以从地面进行数据日志记录！您也可以打开地面站软件（设置正确的端口和波特率），应该可以开始显示 APM 数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:225 9e6832533b4947ceb37aa8b5d821f56b
msgid ""
"Additionally, if you want to test the range of your Xbee link, connect the "
"plane-side Xbee module's RX and TX pins together to create a loopback "
"circuit and use the X-CTU utility's range test function. For the modules we "
"are using you should get around a mile."
msgstr ""
"此外，如果您想测试 Xbee 链路的距离，请将飞机端 Xbee 模块的 RX 和 TX 引脚连接在一起构成回环电路，并使用 X-CTU "
"工具的距离测试功能。使用我们推荐的模块，您应该能达到约一英里的距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:232 e3688ef32bb1490b8c71a164364ef025
msgid ""
"If you've got an Xbee attached to your APM, the USB cable will probably not "
"provide enough power by itself to drive them both. Please also have an ESC "
"and LiPo connected to the RC pins to provide additional power. (You can tell"
" that you've got a low power (\"brownout\") condition if you just have the "
"red C LED blinking dimly, or the APM board is otherwise intermittent.)"
msgstr ""
"如果您将 Xbee 连接到 APM，USB 线缆可能无法单独提供足够的电力同时驱动两者。请同时将 ESC 和 LiPo 电池连接到 RC "
"引脚以补充供电。（如果仅有红色 C LED 在微弱闪烁，或 APM 板出现间歇性故障，则表明存在低电压（「掉电」）问题。）"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:240 258aba492a6b4fa0850363e72f1809ea
msgid "Test code"
msgstr "测试代码"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:242 709aeb4e965444c2872132beb9edcd52
msgid ""
"ArduPilot Mega has four serial ports so all the usual Arduino serial "
"commands now take a specifier to say which port you want to read from or "
"write to. For example: ``Serial1.print()``, ``Serial2.print()``. The port "
"connected to the USB/FDTI connector is Serial0. The port connected to the "
"Telecom pins is Serial3."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot Mega 有四个串口，因此所有常规 Arduino "
"串口命令现在都需要指定要读取或写入的端口。例如：``Serial1.print()``、``Serial2.print()``。连接到 USB/FDTI"
" 接口的端口为 Serial0，连接到 Telecom 引脚的端口为 Serial3。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:248 c05010e95c274a108b4c96aae0017e15
msgid ""
"Plug your Xbee into one USB port and your APM into another. Use Arduino to "
"load the demo code, and then in the Arduino IDE set the serial port to the "
"one assigned to your APM board. Then open the serial monitor, setting the "
"baud rate to 115200. You should see \"Port 0\" repeated as follows, showing "
"the output from the APM's USB port:"
msgstr ""
"将 Xbee 插入一个 USB 端口，将 APM 插入另一个 USB 端口。使用 Arduino 加载示例代码，然后在 Arduino IDE "
"中将串口设置为分配给 APM 板的端口。打开串口监视器，将波特率设置为 115200。您应该看到重复输出的 「Port 0」，这是 APM USB "
"端口的输出："

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:257 877f1047ae124f2fbb09b056e77dae23
msgid ""
"Now switch the serial port to the one your Xbee is assigned to and reopen "
"the serial monitor, setting the baud rate to 57600 (which is the speed your "
"Xbees should already be programmed for). You should now see \"Port 3\" "
"repeated, showing the output from APM's Xbee port."
msgstr ""
"现在将串口切换到 Xbee 所分配的端口，重新打开串口监视器，将波特率设置为 57600（这应该是您的 Xbee 已编程的速度）。现在应该看到重复输出的"
" 「Port 3」，这是 APM Xbee 端口的输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:263 d8b4f99399954fcba2a79b828ba746eb
msgid "Unbricking an Xbee"
msgstr "Xbee 解砖"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:267 f16b7b151f5a416d854b5153f7a35601
msgid ""
"Sometimes Xbee modules get corrupted due to spurious signals. If you're "
"finding that yours stops working (green LED on Adafruit adapter doesn't come"
" on), instructions to reload the firmware follow:"
msgstr "Xbee 模块有时会因杂散信号而损坏。如果您发现模块停止工作（Adafruit 适配器上的绿色 LED 不亮），以下是重新加载固件的说明："

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:272 fc2b74e1b4de4fe0bd40b4fdbb2c6e99
msgid "Using the USB adapter board:"
msgstr "使用 USB 适配器板："

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:274 91d2a3fbca3147a7a5e8fbc2e011116c
msgid "Take the module out of the interface board."
msgstr "将模块从接口板上取下。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:275 3d5f12209a7e4840b4d1d047fcca258f
msgid "Connect the interface board to the computer."
msgstr "将接口板连接到计算机。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:276 f513ee6d6c474cdcb9dcbd367c57e495
msgid "Open X-CTU make sure Baud Rate is set to 9600"
msgstr "打开 X-CTU，确保波特率设置为 9600"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:277 2b951f09c2804d7f92d70f94c977810f
msgid "Go to \"Modem Configuration\""
msgstr "进入 「Modem Configuration」"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:278 4a7fca2190214aa6b58f6b88c0bc57d1
msgid "Put a check in the \"Always update firmware\" box"
msgstr "勾选 「Always update firmware」 复选框"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:279 59368b4f8e2c4c0db68dfbdc0a8eb587
msgid ""
"Select proper modem from drop down menu (for the 900Mhz ones recommended "
"above select \"XBP09-DP\"; for 2.4GHZ Xeebee Pro 2 select \"XBP24-B\")"
msgstr ""
"从下拉菜单中选择正确的调制解调器（对于上述推荐的 900MHz 模块，选择 「XBP09-DP」；对于 2.4GHz Xbee Pro 2，选择 "
"「XBP24-B」）"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:282 3b0e2a7fef68411a99198a9eece12221
msgid ""
"Click on the \"Write\" button. After a few seconds of trying to read the "
"modem, you will get an Info box that says Action Needed. At this point, "
"CAREFULLY insert the module into the interface board. After a few seconds, "
"this should trigger a reloading of the firmware."
msgstr ""
"点击 「Write」 按钮。尝试读取调制解调器数秒后，会弹出提示框显示 Action "
"Needed。此时，请**小心**将模块插入接口板。数秒后，这应该会触发固件的重新加载。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:286 cc5d24181d374db39848e750d08178ab
msgid ""
"You may get the info box again a short while after; if so just repeat the "
"previous step a few times and it should work."
msgstr "稍后可能再次出现提示框；若如此，重复上一步骤几次即可解决。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:288 177f958e8b634cd498bd9adb9db4e790
msgid ""
"This will put the module back to 9600 baud. Set your X-CTU PC settings to "
"that and test it. It should report back that it's recognized."
msgstr "此操作将把模块恢复到 9600 波特率。将 X-CTU PC 设置更改为该速率并测试，应该会正确识别。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:291 e62b3111b952412e9ad8009780105bce
msgid ""
"Once you've confirmed that it's working again, make you sure you reset its "
"baud rate (typically 57k for APM) and VID number to match your other module."
msgstr "确认模块恢复正常后，务必将其波特率（APM 通常为 57k）和 VID 号重置为与另一个模块匹配。"

#: ../../source/docs/xbee-radios.rst:295 895bee579b2346c39baf3c453002020e
msgid "(Thanks to Doug Barnett for these tips)"
msgstr "（感谢 Doug Barnett 提供这些技巧）"
